{"id":"presto","lemma":"presto","pos":"adv","rank":3501,"glosses":["immediately; promptly; soon","presto","right away; at once"],"ipa":"/ˈpɾesto/","examples":[{"text":"Yo te lo presto.","en":"I'll lend it to you.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/449939","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"it / him"},null]},{"text":"Presto dinero.","en":"I borrow money.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/798954","words":[null,{"g":"money"}]},{"text":"Si necesitas un diccionario, te presto el mío viejo.","en":"If you need a dictionary, I'll lend you an old one that I have.","words":[{"g":"if, whether"},{"g":"to need","l":"necesitar"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"dictionary, wordbook"},{"g":"you"},null,{"g":"the"},{"g":"mine"},{"g":"old person"}]},{"text":"Las personas a las que les presto dinero nunca me lo devuelven.","en":"The people I lend money to never pay me back.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/692618","words":[{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"person (an individual","l":"persona"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"them"},null,{"g":"money"},{"g":"never"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"it / him"},{"g":"to return","l":"devolver"}]}]}